# Plan - Install OpenCode and Superpowers Plugin

Installing the OpenCode CLI and configuring it with the Superpowers plugin.

## Proposed Changes

### [INSTALL] OpenCode CLI
- Run `npm install -g opencode-ai`.

### [CONFIGURE] Superpowers Plugin for OpenCode
- Create directories `%USERPROFILE%\.config\opencode\plugins` and `%USERPROFILE%\.config\opencode\skills`.
- Create a symlink for the plugin: `mklink "%USERPROFILE%\.config\opencode\plugins\superpowers.js" "c:\projects\claude+antigravity\Superpowers\.opencode\plugins\superpowers.js"`.
- Create a junction for skills: `mklink /J "%USERPROFILE%\.config\opencode\skills\superpowers" "c:\projects\claude+antigravity\Superpowers\skills"`.

## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
- Run `opencode --version` to verify installation.
- Check symlinks/junctions via `dir /AL`.
